# Datadog agent API key (set in Portainer stack Environment; do not commit real values)
#
# Must be a key from the shaunoneill7@gmail.com org, which lives on EU1
# (DD_SITE=datadoghq.eu in the compose file). Keys are site-scoped: a US1 key
# here returns 403 Forbidden and the agent silently ships nothing. Check a key's
# site before using it:
#   curl -s https://api.datadoghq.eu/api/v1/validate -H "DD-API-KEY: <key>"
DD_API_KEY=replace-with-datadog-api-key
